<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="凡常恩典"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="月行水上: 凡常恩典 (Original Soundtrack)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Monster Siren Records"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Moving point"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="动点"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="動點"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="塞壬唱片-MSR"/><amll:meta key="album" value="月行水上: 凡常恩典 (Original Soundtrack)"/><amll:meta key="album" value="月行水上: 凡常恩典 (Original Soundtrack) - Single"/><amll:meta key="album" value="月行水上OST"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="TWU712627281"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3423857646"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0017ytHd3a6NEP"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="718178883"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="5FktKcNeYkGML3Wl1N7uyF"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6805442895"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:02.160"><div begin="39.310" end="3:02.160"><p begin="39.310" end="46.410" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.310" end="39.420">C</span><span begin="39.420" end="40.150">lear</span> <span begin="40.260" end="40.690">mor</span><span begin="40.850" end="41.420">ning</span> <span begin="41.420" end="42.270">light,</span> <span begin="42.550" end="42.770">your</span> <span begin="42.860" end="43.550">voi</span><span begin="43.550" end="43.650">ce</span> <span begin="43.650" end="43.880">so</span> <span begin="43.880" end="44.070">s</span><span begin="44.070" end="46.370">wee</span><span begin="46.370" end="46.410">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">澄澈的晨光中 你的声音如此温柔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">澄澈的晨光中 你的聲音如此溫柔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">澄みわたる朝の光 君の声はどこまでも優しく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">맑은 아침 햇살 너의 목소리는 너무나 달콤해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Claire lumière du matin ta voix si douce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Clara luz de la mañana tu voz tan dulce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Klares Morgenlicht deine Stimme so sanft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Clara luz da manhã sua voz tão doce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ясный утренний свет твой голос так нежен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chiara luce del mattino la tua voce così dolce</span></p><p begin="47.830" end="55.100" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.830" end="48.200">Lo</span><span begin="48.200" end="48.350">s</span><span begin="48.350" end="48.430">t</span> <span begin="48.430" end="48.550">in</span> <span begin="48.550" end="48.640">a</span> <span begin="48.710" end="49.820">dream,</span> <span begin="50.120" end="50.470">foun</span><span begin="50.470" end="50.630">d a</span><span begin="50.720" end="52.100">gain</span> <span begin="52.200" end="52.770">in</span> <span begin="52.770" end="53.060">you</span><span begin="53.060" end="54.990">r eye</span><span begin="54.990" end="55.100">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾迷失于梦境 又在你的眼中寻回自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曾迷失於夢境 又在你的眼中尋回自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">夢の中で迷い 君の瞳の中でまた自分を見つけた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">꿈속에서 길을 잃고 너의 눈동자 속에서 다시 나를 찾았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Perdu dans un rêve je me retrouve dans tes yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me perdí en un sueño volví a encontrarme en tus ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einem Traum verloren in deinen Augen wiedergefunden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perdido num sonho me reencontro em seus olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потерян во сне и вновь найден в твоих глазах</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perso in un sogno ritrovato nei tuoi occhi</span></p><p begin="56.570" end="59.910" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.570" end="56.730">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="56.840" end="57.030">gi</span><span begin="57.030" end="57.120">ve</span> <span begin="57.120" end="57.590">you</span> <span begin="57.590" end="57.870">my</span> <span begin="57.980" end="59.880">sigh</span><span begin="59.880" end="59.910">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿将我的视界赠予你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我願將我的視界贈予你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この目さえ君に捧げよう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 시야를 너에게 줄게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je te donnerais ma vue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Te daría mi vista</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich würde dir mein Augenlicht schenken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu daria a você minha visão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я отдам тебе своё зрение</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti donerei la mia vista</span></p><p begin="1:01.170" end="1:05.580" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.170" end="1:01.400">For</span><span begin="1:01.500" end="1:02.240">ge</span><span begin="1:02.350" end="1:02.870">t all</span> <span begin="1:02.870" end="1:03.110">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:03.210" end="1:05.580">seen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘却我曾目睹的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">忘卻我曾目睹的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この目で見てきたすべてを忘れて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 보아 온 모든 것을 잊고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’oublierais tout ce que j’ai vu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Olvida todo lo que he visto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">All das vergessen was ich je gesehen habe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esqueceria tudo o que já vi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забудь всё что я видел</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimenticherei tutto ciò che ho visto</span></p><p begin="1:06.470" end="1:16.000" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.470" end="1:06.750">I</span> <span begin="1:06.860" end="1:07.100">could</span> <span begin="1:07.290" end="1:08.980">see,</span> <span begin="1:09.400" end="1:09.690">but</span> <span begin="1:09.690" end="1:10.400">no</span><span begin="1:10.500" end="1:11.430">t a</span><span begin="1:11.430" end="1:11.720">ny</span><span begin="1:11.720" end="1:16.000">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经还能看见 如今却再也不能</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我曾經還能看見 如今卻再也不能</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">かつては見えていた でも今はもう見えない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">볼 수 있었지만 이제는 볼 수 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je pouvais voir mais plus maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Podía ver pero ya no</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich konnte sehen doch jetzt nicht mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu podia enxergar mas não mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда-то я мог видеть но теперь уже нет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Potevo vedere ma ora non più</span></p><p begin="2:26.580" end="2:33.570" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.580" end="2:26.670">C</span><span begin="2:26.670" end="2:27.460">lear</span> <span begin="2:27.460" end="2:27.880">mor</span><span begin="2:28.020" end="2:28.580">ning</span> <span begin="2:28.580" end="2:29.370">ligh<